**Changes from the first version:**

| What changed | Why |
|---|---|
| Added **Fetch Expense Details** Script (node 2) | Simulates pulling `expenseId`, `submittedBy`, `amount`, `category` from your system. Uses trigger input if provided, falls back to sample data. HITL fields now bind from this node, not the trigger. |
