| Both outcomes set to `action: "Continue"` | So both Approve and Reject flow forward through the same log step (previously Reject used `"End"` which would have skipped logging entirely). |
| Replaced two log scripts with one **Log Outcome** Script | Reads `$vars.managerApproval.status` to determine the decision. Includes rejection reason in the log message only when it's present and the decision was Reject. |
| Removed duplicate End nodes — one **End** node | Both branches of the Decision converge on Log Outcome, which exits to a single End. |

